g_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749790/extras/51f3dd7470a05ae282d10e5b093edbed.poster.avif?t=1786178989\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749790/extras/51f3dd7470a05ae282d10e5b093edbed.webm?t=1786178989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749790/extras/51f3dd7470a05ae282d10e5b093edbed.mp4?t=1786178989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749790/extras/04120d21d847a6665435a7ec3d0f1bfa.avif?t=1786178989\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment on Go Kart Island isn't taken up by taking part in some kind of wild event. There's a whole island to explore! From the mountain top, to the airport, to the lagoon there is much to see and do. Find coins, gems and smash the mayor's advertising boards as you take in a seemingly impossible amount of diverse scenery and climates for a single island.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749790/extras/29eebe262f9188ad73830aa3bbc72299.poster.avif?t=1786178989\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749790/extras/29eebe262f9188ad73830aa3bbc72299.webm?t=1786178989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749790/extras/29eebe262f9188ad73830aa3bbc72299.mp4?t=1786178989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
